   "t": "<b>8. What the result changes</b> Positive: contraindicated",
   "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 324\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Ziagen (abacavir) label: her eight worksheet questions, answer 8 highlighted\"><text x=\"180\" y=\"20\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:14px\">Ziagen (abacavir) label</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"36\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"middle\">her worksheet: eight questions per label</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"48\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"67\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">1 Gene and variant</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"61\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">HLA-B</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"74\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">HLA-B*57:01</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"82\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"101\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">2 What it does</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"95\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Hypersensitivity, multi-organ;</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"108\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">can be fatal</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"116\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"135\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">3 Patient or tumor?</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"135\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">The patient (inherited)</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"150\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"169\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">4 Efficacy or toxicity?</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"169\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Prevent toxicity</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"184\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"203\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">5 How it is tested</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"203\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Genotyping (a blood test)</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"218\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"237\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">6 Test named?</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"237\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">No test named</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"252\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3box\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"271\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">7 Who is tested</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"265\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">All patients, before starting</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"278\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">or restarting</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"286\" width=\"344\" height=\"30\" rx=\"5\" class=\"s3hi\"/><text x=\"16\" y=\"305\" class=\"s3sub\" text-anchor=\"start\">8 What the result changes</text><text x=\"164\" y=\"305\" class=\"s3txt\" text-anchor=\"start\" style=\"font-size:12px\">Positive: contraindicated</text></svg>",
   "say": "Item eight: a patient who carries H L A B fifty seven oh one must not receive abacavir, because the label lists it as a contraindication. Whatever the test result, the drug is stopped at once if a hypersensitivity reaction is suspected, and never restarted after a reaction."
